  "description": "The tractor drawbar is designed for 3-point category 0 tractors; It can be fitted with a suitcase to act as a ballast tank to add weight to your tractor's rear and prevent any imbalance or tipping.\nFitment\nUniversal fit for category 0 tractors.\nFeatures\nSuitable for Category 0 Tractors.\nThe tractor drawbar is designed for 3-point category 0 tractors; It can be fitted with a suitcase to act as a ballast tank to add weight to your tractor's rear and prevent any imbalance or tipping.\nVersatile Functionality.\nThe 3 Point hitch receiver has a 2\" Receiver and 2 x 1 3/4\" Hay Spear Holes along with 2xClevis Hooks, multifunctional for hauling vehicles and moving haystacks.\nQuick Disassembly Design.\nThis 3-point receiver drawbar helps change the device at the rear of the tractor for easy and quick assembly and disassembly, widely used in heavy-duty work of industrial, warehouse, and construction work.\nDurable Material.\nThe 3pt drawbar is made from premium stainless steel to achieve a strong and durable structure, with the surface black powder coating for rust and corrosion protection.",
